Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:03:19.44,Title,,0,0,0,,Everytime We Touch
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:09.66,Pair,,0,0,0,,I still hear your voice when you sleep next to me
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.66,0:00:16.48,Pair,,0,0,0,,I still feel your touch in my dreams
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.48,0:00:23.24,Pair,,0,0,0,,Forgive me my weakness but\NI don't know why
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.24,0:00:31.06,Pair,,0,0,0,,Without you it's hard to survive 'Cos everytime we touch
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.06,0:00:34.23,Pair,,0,0,0,,I get this feeling\NAnd everytime we kiss
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.23,0:00:36.34,Pair,,0,0,0,,I swear\NI could fly
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.34,0:00:44.59,Pair,,0,0,0,,Can't you feel my heart beat fast?\NI want this to last need you by my side 'Cos everytime we touch
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.59,0:00:47.76,Pair,,0,0,0,,I feel the static\NAnd everytime we kiss
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.76,0:00:52.19,Pair,,0,0,0,,I reach for the sky\NCan't you hear my heart beat so?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.19,0:01:39.30,Pair,,0,0,0,,I can't let you go want you in my life
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.30,0:01:46.06,Pair,,0,0,0,,Your arms are my castle your heart is my sky
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.06,0:01:52.82,Pair,,0,0,0,,They wipe away tears that\NI cry
